{"id":"bd8ZRCkzwmOIIXkN","meta":{"instanceId":"9994cba6d289c6e05ad7178d0be7037dc11e0a50d5ae1f85bcc752a4dc62e688","templateCredsSetupCompleted":true},"name":"Generate LinkedIn posts from bullet points with Gemini","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"1ff55f30-cf91-4568-9f16-ea2d9863d176","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-32,16],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":816,"content":"## Generate LinkedIn posts from bullet points with Gemini\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives bullet points through a webhook, applies configurable post settings, and uses Gemini to generate three LinkedIn post variations. It then uses a second Gemini step to score those variations, runs code to select the best one, logs the result to Google Sheets, and returns the generated content to the webhook caller.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the webhook URL and request payload so it sends the expected bullet points and any optional tone, post type, or author values.\n- Add Google Gemini credentials for both LLM chain nodes and verify the models are available in your n8n instance.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the target spreadsheet, sheet, and columns used for logging the generated and selected post data.\n- Review the Set Configuration node defaults for bullet_points, tone, post_type, and author_name before activating the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the post-generation prompt, scoring criteria, default tone, post type, and Google Sheets columns to match your LinkedIn content style and reporting needs."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"cde39c12-b9e4-4a1e-849d-45902814aa84","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[512,80],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":496,"height":336,"content":"## Receive post inputs\n\nWebhook entry point and nearby configuration step that collect submitted bullet points and normalize the key settings used by the rest of the workflow."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"066fb6aa-20c5-4e44-b8f6-39bad897aa95","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1056,80],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":512,"height":544,"content":"## Generate post variations\n\nGemini-powered LLM chain that creates three LinkedIn post options from the configured bullet points, with a structured parser to format the generated variations."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"5cb433cd-2e04-4180-ae4b-3649c428a850","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1648,80],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":512,"content":"## Score generated variations\n\nSecond Gemini LLM cluster that evaluates all three generated posts and parses the scores into a structured format for comparison."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"30e455bc-aafe-46c2-b04b-7efba6367bcd","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2144,64],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":336,"height":400,"content":"## Select winning post\n\nCustom code step that compares the scored variations and chooses the best LinkedIn post to continue through the workflow."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0e4b4196-9cae-44b5-9436-ffb7a4c16101","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2576,80],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":544,"height":400,"content":"## Log and respond\n\nFinal output cluster that records the selected result in Google Sheets and sends the completed response back to the original webhook request."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"22e0abc2-21c6-46e7-a9ca-a49cf466cc42","name":"When Bullet Points Submitted","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[560,256],"webhookId":"REPLACE_ON_ACTIVATION","parameters":{"path":"linkedin-generator","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST","responseMode":"responseNode"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"2660d2a8-1545-41cb-84bf-32cd615190ae","name":"Set Post Parameters","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[816,256],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"cfg-1","name":"bullet_points","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.body.bullet_points }}"},{"id":"cfg-2","name":"tone","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.body.tone || 'Professional' }}"},{"id":"cfg-3","name":"post_type","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.body.post_type || 'Thought leadership' }}"},{"id":"cfg-4","name":"author_name","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.body.author_name || '' }}"},{"id":"cfg-5","name":"sheet_id","type":"string","value":"REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"},{"id":"cfg-6","name":"sheet_name","type":"string","value":"Posts"}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"35fd9719-2dcf-4ffe-b1f6-77be3e094654","name":"Generate Post Variations","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","position":[1264,256],"parameters":{"text":"=You are an expert LinkedIn content writer. Generate exactly THREE distinct LinkedIn post variations from the bullet points below.\n\nBullet points: {{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.bullet_points }}\nTone: {{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.tone }}\nPost type: {{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.post_type }}\n{{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.author_name ? 'Sign off with: ' + $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.author_name : '' }}\n\nRules for each variation:\n- Under 1300 characters\n- Start with a strong hook (first line must make someone stop scrolling)\n- No generic openers like \"In today's world\" or \"I'm excited to share\"\n- Each variation must use a structurally different approach: different hook style, different format (one can use line breaks, one prose, one a short list), different opening angle on the same material\n- No hashtags unless they add real value\n\nReturn all three variations clearly separated.","batching":{},"promptType":"define","hasOutputParser":true},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"26be54d9-bae4-42b1-be16-8a62fc70261e","name":"Gemini Generate Variations","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","position":[1184,480],"parameters":{"options":{}},"credentials":{"googlePalmApi":{"id":"e5dDGQvP66RyAPWF","name":"Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account 2"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8aa722a0-16c5-46f8-a1b2-076bc56ee7b6","name":"Parse Variations Output","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured","position":[1392,480],"parameters":{"schemaType":"manual","inputSchema":"{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"variation_1\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"variation_2\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"variation_3\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"variation_1\",\n    \"variation_2\",\n    \"variation_3\"\n  ]\n}"},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"f83beef3-b927-43a6-8681-be0a576a6402","name":"Score Variations","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","position":[1776,256],"parameters":{"text":"=Score these three LinkedIn posts independently. For each, give a score from 1-10 for: hook_strength (does the first line make you stop scrolling?), readability (does it flow naturally?), and engagement_potential (would a professional audience like, comment, or share this?). Be honest and differentiate between them.\n\nPost 1:\n{{ $json.output.variation_1 }}\n\nPost 2:\n{{ $json.output.variation_2 }}\n\nPost 3:\n{{ $json.output.variation_3 }}","batching":{},"promptType":"define","hasOutputParser":true},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"086c0f87-a12d-4a4a-80e2-e0aa00a67802","name":"Gemini Score Variations","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","position":[1712,448],"parameters":{"options":{}},"credentials":{"googlePalmApi":{"id":"e5dDGQvP66RyAPWF","name":"Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account 2"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"4d5b059d-0744-419f-90ab-acf5f67039e3","name":"Parse Scores Output","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured","position":[1888,464],"parameters":{"schemaType":"manual","inputSchema":"{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"post_1\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"hook_strength\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"readability\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"engagement_potential\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"post_2\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"hook_strength\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"readability\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"engagement_potential\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"post_3\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"hook_strength\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"readability\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"engagement_potential\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"post_1\",\n    \"post_2\",\n    \"post_3\"\n  ]\n}"},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"bfd43fff-cda6-4180-bce8-0c60939c0114","name":"Select Best Variation","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2256,256],"parameters":{"jsCode":"function escHtml(str) {\n  return (str || '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/\"/g, '&quot;');\n}\nconst variations = $('Generate Post Variations').first().json.output;\nconst scores = $json.output;\n\nfunction total(s) {\n  return (s.hook_strength || 0) + (s.readability || 0) + (s.engagement_potential || 0);\n}\n\nconst t1 = total(scores.post_1);\nconst t2 = total(scores.post_2);\nconst t3 = total(scores.post_3);\n\nlet winner, winnerScore, winnerIndex;\nif (t1 >= t2 && t1 >= t3) { winner = variations.variation_1; winnerScore = t1; winnerIndex = 1; }\nelse if (t2 >= t3) { winner = variations.variation_2; winnerScore = t2; winnerIndex = 2; }\nelse { winner = variations.variation_3; winnerScore = t3; winnerIndex = 3; }\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    variation_1: escHtml(variations.variation_1),\n    variation_2: escHtml(variations.variation_2),\n    variation_3: escHtml(variations.variation_3),\n    score_1: t1,\n    score_2: t2,\n    score_3: t3,\n    hook_1: scores.post_1.hook_strength,\n    readability_1: scores.post_1.readability,\n    engagement_1: scores.post_1.engagement_potential,\n    hook_2: scores.post_2.hook_strength,\n    readability_2: scores.post_2.readability,\n    engagement_2: scores.post_2.engagement_potential,\n    hook_3: scores.post_3.hook_strength,\n    readability_3: scores.post_3.readability,\n    engagement_3: scores.post_3.engagement_potential,\n    recommended_post: escHtml(winner),\n    recommended_index: winnerIndex,\n    recommended_score: winnerScore\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"1def7846-49b8-4289-b3a5-6351f730cff5","name":"Append to Google Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2624,256],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"tone":"={{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.tone }}","score_1":"={{ $json.score_1 }}","score_2":"={{ $json.score_2 }}","score_3":"={{ $json.score_3 }}","post_type":"={{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.post_type }}","variation_1":"={{ $json.variation_1 }}","variation_2":"={{ $json.variation_2 }}","variation_3":"={{ $json.variation_3 }}","generated_at":"={{ $now.toISO() }}","bullet_points":"={{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.bullet_points }}","recommended_index":"={{ $json.recommended_index }}"},"mappingMode":"defineBelow"},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.sheet_name }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Post Parameters').item.json.sheet_id }}"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"PtBi6aeguuZ0CQsR","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"c2abd521-ab6d-4e77-899f-73e7ff05d39d","name":"Respond with Results","type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","position":[2928,256],"parameters":{"options":{"responseHeaders":{"entries":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"text/html"}]}},"respondWith":"text","responseBody":"=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><style>\nbody { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; color: #1a1a1a; }\n.winner { background: #f0f7ff; border-left: 4px solid #0077b5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 32px; }\n.winner h2 { color: #0077b5; margin-top: 0; }\n.variation { background: #f9f9f9; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding: 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.scores { font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-top: 8px; }\n.score-badge { background: #0077b5; color: white; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }\npre { white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; }\n</style></head>\n<body>\n<h1>💼 LinkedIn Posts Generated</h1>\n<div class=\"winner\">\n<h2>⭐ Recommended: Post {{ $json.recommended_index }} <span class=\"score-badge\">Score {{ $json.recommended_score }}/30</span></h2>\n<pre>{{ $json.recommended_post }}</pre>\n</div>\n<h3>All Three Variations</h3>\n<div class=\"variation\">\n<strong>Variation 1</strong> <span class=\"score-badge\">{{ $json.score_1 }}/30</span>\n<div class=\"scores\">Hook {{ $json.hook_1 }} &bull; Readability {{ $json.readability_1 }} &bull; Engagement {{ $json.engagement_1 }}</div>\n<pre>{{ $json.variation_1 }}</pre>\n</div>\n<div class=\"variation\">\n<strong>Variation 2</strong> <span class=\"score-badge\">{{ $json.score_2 }}/30</span>\n<div class=\"scores\">Hook {{ $json.hook_2 }} &bull; Readability {{ $json.readability_2 }} &bull; Engagement {{ $json.engagement_2 }}</div>\n<pre>{{ $json.variation_2 }}</pre>\n</div>\n<div class=\"variation\">\n<strong>Variation 3</strong> <span class=\"score-badge\">{{ $json.score_3 }}/30</span>\n<div class=\"scores\">Hook {{ $json.hook_3 }} &bull; Readability {{ $json.readability_3 }} &bull; Engagement {{ $json.engagement_3 }}</div>\n<pre>{{ $json.variation_3 }}</pre>\n</div>\n</body></html>"},"typeVersion":1.1}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"21a79261-e828-4c5f-bd84-ba29ea18911e","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"Score Variations":{"main":[[{"node":"Select Best Variation","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Parse Scores Output":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"Score Variations","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]},"Set Post Parameters":{"main":[[{"node":"Generate Post Variations","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Select Best Variation":{"main":[[{"node":"Append to Google Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Append to Google Sheets":{"main":[[{"node":"Respond with Results","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Gemini Score Variations":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Score Variations","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Parse Variations Output":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"Generate Post Variations","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]},"Generate Post Variations":{"main":[[{"node":"Score Variations","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Gemini Generate Variations":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Generate Post Variations","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"When Bullet Points Submitted":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Post Parameters","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}